              720 × 300 • APEX HORIZON
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-2">
              Spire Sunset Dive
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/70 line-clamp-2 mb-4">
              High-altitude aerialist silhouette bathed in sunset amber twilight, loop-perfect motion.
            </p>
            <a
